    description: Some("Two riders chase a ball around a small field, swinging mallets to knock it through the opponent\'s goal. Your horse builds speed as you steer and keeps it if you reverse sharply; the mallet only connects when its head is down near the hooves, and the swing angle plus your speed decide where the ball goes. Holding the button swings away from the goal instead of toward it."),
